        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Day After, I Like to Rock\n- Places: Kansas, De Soto High School, K-10\n\nFacts:\n- The Day After is a 1982 film that aired in 1983.\n- The Day After was the seventh highest rated non-sports show.\n- The Day After featured an American state highway.\n- The highway featured in The Day After is K-10 in Kansas.\n- De Soto High School in Kansas is located off K-10.\n- The album I Like to Rock was recorded in Kansas.",
